title: 'Public hero pages merged: five pages that say what is built, what is not, and where each number comes from'
summary: 'PR #104 merged into feat/gnomon-dimensions. A hub, pages for Paradigm, Gnomon and Warpline, a Learn path with a printable field card, and a 404, as static files for GitHub Pages. Every number is stamped from one facts file with its source and date; a release check refuses a hand-typed digit. GitHub Pages itself is not yet enabled on the repo.'
symbols_touched:
  - '#site'
  - '#gnomon'
  - '#warpline'
learnings:
  - One facts file with sources, stamped into the pages and enforced by a checker, turns honesty from a habit into a build failure
  - A page can be both striking and candid; the edge came from true, specific statements and from showing the real artefact
  - Design review needs to render at phone widths and at the fold; both specimen and build failed there first
  - A drawing of a product must carry its label inside the frame that will be cropped and shared
  - Check that new directories are not caught by an existing ignore rule before reporting them committed
